    if (trimmed == '---' or '***' or '___') → <hr>
    if table detect: line contains '|' and next line is delimiter row ^\s*\|?[\s:|-]+\|?\s*$ with dashes → parse table
    if list item ^\s*[-*+]\s+ or ^\s*\d+[.)]\s+ → collect consecutive items → <ul>/<ol>
    if blockquote ^\s*>\s? → collect → <blockquote><p>
    else paragraph accumulate until blank/special.
  }
