        'the shape-detecting RedactionPipeline, their layers, attach '
        'points, and configuration.',
  ),
  DocsSource(
    'migrating-from-claude-copilot-codex',
    'docs/migrating-from-claude-copilot-codex.md',
    '2026-10-10',
